Everything related to the current mango/caelestia setup, grouped together
since ../hypr and the rest of ../ are Hyprland-era and no longer active.

mangowc/       ACTIVE. mango's own compositor config (conf.d/*.conf,
               config.conf). Was symlinked into kamalen-shell before that
               got dropped; now a standalone copy in its own right.

caelestia/     ACTIVE. The caelestia-shell-mango source (a MangoWC port of
               caelestia-shell, github.com/evoziosk/caelestia-shell-mango)
               plus shell.json (wallpaperDir pointed at ~/wallpapers). This
               is what actually renders the bar/dashboard/launcher/etc now.
               docs/fixes.rst in here documents local fixes on top of that
               fork that haven't (yet, or ever) made it upstream.

wallpapers/    ACTIVE. The ~/wallpapers pool caelestia's shell.json points
               at. One file over GitHub's 100MB limit is gitignored and
               stays local-only, see the repo .gitignore.

kamalenshell/  LEGACY, NOT ACTIVELY USED. Last live snapshot of kamalen-shell
               before it was replaced by caelestia-shell-mango. Kept for
               reference/rollback, not being re-synced from a live source
               (there isn't one anymore -- kamalen-shell itself was removed).
